<title>USA: Pittsburgh, Pa., school GOs won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Pittsburgh, Pa., school GOs won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it won $32.4 million of Pittsburgh, Pa., school district general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.6321 percent.</p>
</text>
